OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry start
OL,6,Fto the evening then cloud thickening
OL,7,Fto bring some outbreaks of rain,
OL,8,Freaching the far south by the early
OL,9,Fhours. Some of the rain will be on the
OL,10,Fheavy side in the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA cloudy morning with some
OL,13,Frain. The Lothians and north Borders
OL,14,Fbrightening up by afternoon with some
OL,15,Fsunshine but rain may linger until
OL,16,Fevening in south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
