OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry,
OL,6,Fbright with variable amounts of cloud
OL,7,Fand some hazy sunny spells. Chance of
OL,8,Fshowers on Wednesday. Becoming warm or
OL,9,Fvery warm, but fresher at times on the
OL,10,Feast coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
